# Run artifacts and generated output that land directly under unitune/ (data, not
# source). Regenerable from scripts/gendba/unitune_*.sh + the committed base config.
#
# NOTE: this file governs ONLY files directly under unitune/. Content INSIDE the
# submodules (unitune/UniTune, unitune/open-box-context) is NOT covered here -- git
# delegates that to each submodule's own git, and it is silenced by
# `ignore = untracked` on those submodules in ../.gitmodules. So the UniTune run logs
# (unitune/UniTune/logs/*.log) are handled there, not by this file.

*.log
*.out
logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.ipynb_checkpoints/
